---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro"; import SiteHeader from "../components/SiteHeader.astro"; import SiteFooter from "../components/SiteFooter.astro"; import DiscussProjectSection from "../components/DiscussProjectSection.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About | Glavas Engineering"><SiteHeader /><main><section class="section about-section"><div class="container about-page"><div class="page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Façade and building-envelope thermal analysis.</h1></div><div class="about-page__copy"><p class="lead">Architect specialising in façade and building-envelope thermal analysis, with a professional background in façade engineering.</p><p>I hold a Master of Building Architecture from Politecnico di Milano. Following my work as a façade engineer, my focus shifted to specialised thermal analysis, with the past three years dedicated to the thermal performance of façade systems and building-envelope details.</p><h2>Experience</h2><p>More than 10 large-scale commercial projects in the UK have formed part of my experience to date.</p><p>The work has ranged from complete thermal-assessment packages covering multiple façade types and junctions to detailed 2D and 3D analysis of complex individual connections.</p><p>This combination of façade-engineering experience and thermal modelling provides an understanding of both the thermal behaviour of a detail and the way it is designed and constructed.</p></div></div></section><DiscussProjectSection location="about_cta" /></main><SiteFooter /></BaseLayout>
<style>
  .page-hero{background:url("/assets/blueprints/background-template-4.svg") center / cover no-repeat}.about-page { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:4rem; }
  .about-page__copy { max-width:42rem; }
  .about-page__copy p { color:var(--color-slate); }
  .about-page__copy .lead { font-size:1.25rem; }
  .about-page__copy h2 { margin-top:4rem; font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.5rem); }
  @media(max-width:44rem){ .page-hero{background-image:url("/assets/blueprints/background-template-4-mobile.svg")} .about-page{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:2rem}.about-page__copy h2{margin-top:3rem} }
</style>
